<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Built by Claude — RHEL 10 Demo</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #CC0000 0%, #1A1A2E 100%);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 48px 56px;
      max-width: 720px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #fff; }
    h2 { color: #FFD2D2; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 12px; }
    th { text-align: left; padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); color: #FFE6E6; }
    td { padding: 8px 12px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
    .footer { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    code { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: Menlo, monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Built by Claude</h1>
    <h2>Ansible Automation Platform — RHEL 10 Showcase Lab</h2>
    <p>This server was provisioned, configured, and deployed end-to-end by Red Hat
       Ansible Automation Platform 2.6 driving a Claude-authored automation library.</p>

    <table>
      <tr><th>Host</th><td>{{ ansible_hostname | default('compliance-lab-rhel10') }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>OS</th><td>{{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }} ({{ ansible_architecture }})</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Kernel</th><td>{{ ansible_kernel }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Provisioned</th><td>{{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Web server</th><td>nginx (port 80, SELinux enforcing)</td></tr>
    </table>

    <p class="footer">
      Customer use cases demonstrated: <code>Server Provisioning</code> ·
      <code>Day 1/Day 2 Config</code> · <code>Patch Management</code> ·
      <code>User Management</code> · <code>ITSM Integration</code> ·
      <code>CIS Benchmarks</code>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
